  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A simple pendulum has a time period <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> on the Earth. The pendulum is taken to the Moon where the gravitational field strength is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{6}\"></span> that of the Earth.</p>\n<p>What is the time period of the pendulum on the Moon?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\\sqrt{6}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{6}T\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{T}{6}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
